WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.900
For hundreds of thousands of years,
humans followed the sun.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:11.370
Its light told our bodies when to wake,
work, rest, and sleep.

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:14.880
Then we made our own light.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.600
Too bright at midnight.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.330
Too dim at noon.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.560
Different everywhere we go.

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:24.300
And our rhythm lost its signal.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.350
Sun Signal gives it back.

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:31.220
Your sun. Your day. Where you are.
